OL,3,GNEWSAI buried my son and partner - I
OL,4,Awant answers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose son and partner both died
OL,7,Ffollowing failures in their care under
OL,8,FNHS services in Essex has said she will
OL,9,Fnot stop fighting for answers.
OL,11,FAn inquest concluded there were several
OL,12,Fmissed opportunities to assess
OL,13,F81-year-old Colin Flatt's mental
OL,14,Fcapacity before he fell from height at
OL,15,Fhospital in July 2021.
OL,17,FHis partner, Melanie Leahy, told the
OL,18,FBBC: "I haven't just been let down, my
OL,19,Ffamily has been wiped out." Her son
OL,20,FMatthew Leahy died at a mental health
OL,21,Funit in 2012.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
